      "body": "Hi! I'd like to investigate and work on this issue if it's still available.\nI've gone through the reproduction and the distinction between tr(musig(A,B)/<0;1>/*) and tr(musig(A/<0;1>/*,B/<0;1>/*)) looks particularly interesting. I'd like to trace how bip32derivs=false affects the MuSig2 signing path, understand whether the derivation information can be obtained internally without exposing it in the PSBT, and then work on a fix and regression test.\nIs anyone currently working on this? If not, would it be okay for me to take it?",
